  <description value="The 14 bands of the Dynamic Decile System: four bands below the requirement minimum, as a share of the minimum, and ten deciles from the minimum to the range high. Where an entry gets a band, a value above the range high is in range-d10 unless it is below the minimum. The computation is stated, proposed and pending ratification, on the [Decile Basis and Band Computation](band-computation.html) page."/>
